{"page":493527,"revision":1376891610,"ref":"o3","kind":"example","cue":"heading","strength":"strong","name":"Example","section":"Example","section_anchor":"Example","span":[2129,3479],"text":"## Example\nThe symmetric group S3 has the following multiplication table.\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n|-\n! •\n! e || s || t || u || v || w\n|-\n! e\n| e || s || t || u || v || w\n|-\n! s\n| s || e || v || w || t || u\n|-\n! t\n| t || u || e || s || w || v\n|-\n! u\n| u || t || w || v || e || s\n|-\n! v\n| v || w || s || e || u || t\n|-\n! w\n| w || v || u || t || s || e\n|}\nThis group has six elements, so $\\operatorname{ord}(S_{3}) = 6$. By definition, the order of the identity, $e$, is one, since $e^{1} = e$. Each of $s$, $t$, and $w$ squares to $e$, so these group elements have order two: $|s| = |t| = |w| = 2$. Finally, $u$ and $v$ have order 3, since $u^{3} = vu = e$, and $v^{3} = uv = e$.","math":[{"form":"template","tex":"\\operatorname{ord}(S_{3}) = 6","source":"{{math|1=ord(S<sub>3</sub>)&nbsp;= 6}}","span":[2952,2990]},{"form":"template","tex":"e","source":"{{math|''e''}}","span":[3034,3048]},{"form":"template","tex":"e^{1} = e","source":"{{math|1=''e'' <sup>1</sup> = ''e''}}","span":[3064,3101]},{"form":"template","tex":"s","source":"{{math|''s''}}","span":[3111,3125]},{"form":"template","tex":"t","source":"{{math|''t''}}","span":[3127,3141]},{"form":"template","tex":"w","source":"{{math|''w''}}","span":[3147,3161]},{"form":"template","tex":"e","source":"{{math|''e''}}","span":[3173,3187]},{"form":"template","tex":"|s| = |t| = |w| = 2","source":"{{math|1={{!}}''s''{{!}} = {{!}}''t''{{!}} = {{!}}''w''{{!}} = 2}}","span":[3229,3295]},{"form":"template","tex":"u","source":"{{math|''u''}}","span":[3306,3320]},{"form":"template","tex":"v","source":"{{math|''v''}}","span":[3325,3339]},{"form":"template","tex":"u^{3} = vu = e","source":"{{math|1=''u''<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= ''vu''&nbsp;= ''e''}}","span":[3360,3415]},{"form":"template","tex":"v^{3} = uv = e","source":"{{math|1=''v''<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= ''uv''&nbsp;= ''e''}}","span":[3421,3476]}],"links":[{"title":"Symmetric group"},{"title":"Cayley table"}],"hash":"sha256:59311e4e6b8494d34cd6dae0120c31faadc43ebbed43076c51ff2da9457683b0","extractor":"m2/v0.3.8"}
